<%# The Google setup modal, opened by studio/google_sign_in/_button while the
    app has no OAuth client. One root element: the host's template x-if clones
    only the first. No double quote inside any x-data or @click below.

    Locals:
      email_fallback — true: "Use email instead" closes the modal and focuses
                       the page's email field. false: "Not now" only closes it.
                       The focus waits out the close: the host hands focus
                       back to the opener when its last card leaves (220ms,
                       CLOSE_ANIM_MS), which would otherwise undo it.

    "Request Google setup" is a plain form POST with Turbo off, so it works with
    the same CSRF token as every other engine form, and the flash on the page it
    lands back on says what happened. Hidden when the host draws its own routes
    without Studio.routes, which leaves nowhere to send it. %>
<%
  setup_email_fallback = local_assigns.fetch(:email_fallback, true)
  setup_request_path = respond_to?(:studio_google_setup_request_path) ? studio_google_setup_request_path : nil
%>
<div class="text-center" data-google-setup-modal>
  <div class="flex justify-end -mt-2 -mr-2">
    <button type="button" @click="$store.googleSetupModals.close()"
            class="text-secondary hover:text-heading text-xl leading-none"
            aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
  </div>

  <div class="mx-auto mb-4 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-white border border-subtle shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center">
    <%= render "components/google_logo" %>
  </div>

  <h3 class="text-heading font-bold text-lg leading-tight">Google sign-in is almost ready</h3>
  <p class="text-secondary text-sm mt-2">
    Google sign-in is still being set up for <%= Studio.app_name %>.
    <% if setup_request_path %>Ask the team to finish it, and<% else %>Until it is,<% end %>
    <% if setup_email_fallback %>sign in with your email in the meantime.<% else %>use another sign-in method in the meantime.<% end %>
  </p>

  <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col gap-3">
    <% if setup_request_path %>
      <%= button_to "Request Google setup", setup_request_path, method: :post,
            data: { turbo: false }, class: "btn btn-primary w-full", form: { class: "w-full" } %>
    <% end %>

    <% if setup_email_fallback %>
      <button type="button" class="btn btn-neutral w-full"
              @click="$store.googleSetupModals.close(); setTimeout(() => document.querySelector('input[type=email]')?.focus(), 260)">
        Use email instead
      </button>
    <% else %>
      <button type="button" class="btn btn-neutral w-full" @click="$store.googleSetupModals.close()">
        Not now
      </button>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</div>
